      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. I'll improve understandability by:\n- Removing unused imports\n- Renaming `ru` to `randomUtils` for clarity\n- Extracting the magic number `42.1` into a named constant\n- Adding a `@DisplayName` annotation to make the intent explicit\n- Improving the JavadocThe improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed unused imports, renamed `ru` to `randomUtils`, extracted the magic number `42.1` into a `DEGENERATE_RANGE_VALUE` constant, added a `@DisplayName` annotation, and improved the Javadoc to make the zero-width range contract explicit."
